 trustworthy Web site to obtain user's personal or financial information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235059">phishing website</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1371685">веб-локација за крадење идентитет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11280_133179_1707431"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A utility that enables the user to locate and open files and folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="133179">Windows Explorer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1707431">File Explorer</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11280_133179_442055"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A utility that enables the user to locate and open files and folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="133179">Windows Explorer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="442055">Windows Explorer</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp