ular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1371705">ИРП</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11699_63276_1371704"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Data structures that drivers use to communicate with each other.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="63276">IRP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1371704">Пакет барања за В/И</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11699_63276_1371705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Data structures that drivers use to communicate with each other.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="63276">IRP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1371705">ИРП</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11707_237298_1868202"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables the user to create, manage and apply standardized citations and references in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237298">Reference Builder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868202">Градител на референци</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11709_86813_1371706"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A program file used to connect to a particular database. Each database program, such as Access or dBASE, or database management system, such as SQL Server, requires a different driver.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="86813">ODBC driver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1371706">ОДБЦ-двигател</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1171_13558_1867959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technical article, written and distributed by Microsoft, that provides additional information about a Microsoft product or a fix for a known issue.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="13558">application note</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1867959">Белешка на апликација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11712_307435_2305586"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows access to SharePoint documents and sites and documents on shares inside of a corporate network through Outlook Web Access when it is used remotely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307435">LinkAccess</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2305586">Врска за пристап</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11717_343653_443059"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To find.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="343653">locate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="443059">пронајди</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11727_231965_1868158"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Components that can be installed on your computer to add commands and functions to Excel. These add-in programs are specific to Excel. Other add-in programs that are available for Excel or Office are Component Object Model (COM) add-ins.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231965">Excel add-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></lan