leting. Sync errors are typically caused by problems with the device, network folder, or other computer you are trying to sync with.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="269335">sync error</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="442675">грешка при синхронизација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12560_257510_2769946"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An identifier used by two APPC logical units (LUs) to validate security when a session is activated. The security key performs a function similar to that of a password, but at the LU-LU session level rather than at the TP-conversation level.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="257510">security key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2769946">безбедносен клуч</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12562_232859_1868194"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A stand-alone, dynamic-link library that, when loaded, can add custom commands that extend the functionality of Microsoft Word. Commands and functions in a loaded WLL are also available to Microsoft Visual Basic projects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232859">Word Add-in Library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammati