phical images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="64659">imaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441642">обработка на графика</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14171_28508_2631687"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A detailed description of the processes specific customers engage in when selecting product solutions and technologies for deployment in response to business or technological challenges.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="28508">case study</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2631687">студија на случај</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14178_1511499_2767449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A piece of text entered by a user that is displayed to contacts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1511499">personal note</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2767449">лична белешка</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14178_502941_2767449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A piece of text entered by a user that is displayed to contacts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="502941">note</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2767449">лична белешка</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1418_35626_441426"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A window that mimics an old MS-DOS display for typing command-line instructions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="35626">command prompt window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441426">прозорец на команден промпт</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14189_233405_1372445"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The list or table that's used to create a PivotTable or PivotChart report. Source data can be taken from an Excel list or range, an external database or cube, or another PivotTable report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233405">source data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372445">изворни податоци</term><termN