istribution group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2305528">група за динамична дистрибуција</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1488_136966_442089"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A row in the upper part of the Macro window in which you enter macro names, actions, conditions, and comments associated with a particular macro or macro group.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136966">action row</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="442089">ред на дејствие</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14881_1507602_1523045"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An alphanumeric convention for referencing the location of cells in a worksheet. The column is represented by a letter (A through IV, for a total of 256 columns) and the row is represented by a number (1 through 65536).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507602">A1</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1523045">А1</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><