 element of the new Windows Aero experience is the professional-looking, transparent glass design, which creates an open, lightweight environment but more importantly enables users to focus on their content rather than the interface.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777773">Windows Aero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="442495">Автентично, енергично, рефлективно и отворено</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adverb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15369_71392_441680"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A specified amount of processing performed as a unit by a computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="71392">job</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441680">задача</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15371_210471_1522856"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A logical unit consisting of shared services and shared resources. A farm could have multiple SRPs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210471">Shared Resource Provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1522856">Давател на споделени ресурси</term><termNote type="geographic