 the category axis.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650157">category field</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868284">поле за категорија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17800_650160_1868285"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A way to see if a certificate used to sign a message is valid. Outlook can check the status of the certificate from the issuing certification authority's database.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650160">certificate revocation checking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868285">проверка на отповикани потврди</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17811_650171_1868286"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Visual Basic for Applications, the window that is used to display, edit, and write module-level and procedure code.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650171">code pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868286">окно со кодови</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17814_650174_1868287"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keyword or phrase with an associated color that helps you keep track of items, such as messages, contacts, and appointments. You can use color categories to easily find, sort, filter, or group items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650174">color category</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868287">категорија на боја</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17815_650175_1868288"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The part of PivotTable view that contains column fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650175">column area</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868288">област со колони</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17816_1507691_1372488"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A supplemental program with the filename extension .dll or .exe that extends the capabilities of a program by adding custom commands and specialized features.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507691">Component Object Model add-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372488">КОМ-додаток</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17816_650176_1372488"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A supplemental program with the filename extension .dll or .exe that extends the capabilities of a program by adding custom commands and specialized features.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650176">COM add-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372488">КОМ-додаток</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1782_130364_2631701"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The representation of information and data in the form of an image, diagram, or animation. For example, some databases can interpret and show data in the form of a two- or three-dimensional model.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="130364">visualization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2631701">визуелизација на податоци</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1782_2396693_2631701"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The representation of information and data in the form of an image, diagram, or animation. For example, some databases can interpret and show data in the form of a two- or three-dimensional model.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396693">visual</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2631701">визуелизација на податоци</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1782_2626823_2631701"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The representation of information and data in the form of an image, diagram, or animation. For example, some databases can interpret and show data in the form of a two- or three-dimensional model.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2626823">data visualization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2631701">визуелизација на податоци</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17823_650183_1372489"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A format, such as cell shading or font color, that Excel automatically applies to cells if a specified condition is true.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650183">conditional format</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372489">условен формат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17826_650186_1371855"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The type of Web Part connection. For example, the Provide Row To connection type passes a row of data from one Web Part to another Web Part.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650186">connection type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1371855">тип поврзување</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17827_650187_1868289"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view of an individual contact that contains all the information stored in the contact.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650187">contact form</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868289">формулар со контакти</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17828_650188_1372490"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of buttons used to move through contact items displayed in Address Cards or Detailed Address Cards view. The Contact index moves the focus to the first contact whose name begins with the selected character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650188">Contact index</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372490">Индекс за контактот</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17829_650189_1095904"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft SQL Server or WMSDE database that contains the content for one or more SharePoint sites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650189">content database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1095904">база на содржини</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17831_650191_1953717"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The shape of how scheduled work for an assignment is distributed across time. Use a contour to control how Project schedules the work of a resource.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650191">contour</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1953717">контура</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17842_650202_1372491"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A color that is essential to the CMY color model and the CMYK color-mixing method.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650202">cyan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372491">тиркизна</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17844_650204_1372492"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A programming interface to access and manipulate database objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650204">DAO</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372492">ДАО</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17844_650204_1868309"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A programming interface to access and manipulate database objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650204">DAO</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote><