 possible values for an independent variable in a function or for a database attribute.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="47550">domain</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441530">домен</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27527_1379734_1520100"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tooltip displayed when pointing to a personal folder icon on the Manage folders page on the Windows Live Devices website.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1379734">Synced folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520100">Синхронизирана папка</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2755_550_441125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chunk of data that a Web server sends to a browser, which in turn saves it and sends it back when accessing the Web server again.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="550">cookie</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441125">колаче</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termN