ected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29132_3145165_3146184"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A sort order in which text strings are arranged in reverse alphabetical order, numerical values are arranged from largest to smallest, and dates and times are arranged from newest to oldest.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3145165">Z to A</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3146184">Од Ш до А</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29133_1506689_1943277"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of grouping that removes documents with duplicate or near-duplicate content from search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506689">duplicate result removal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943277">отстранување дуплиран резултат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29133_1783060_1943277"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of grouping that removes documents with duplicate or near-duplicate content from search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1783060">duplicate removal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943277">отстранување дуплиран резултат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29133_1783061_1943277"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of grouping that removes documents with duplicate or near-duplicate content from search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1783061">duplicate trimming</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943277">отстранување дуплиран резултат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29134_1506693_1943278"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component of the rank that depends on how well query text matches an indexed item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506693">dynamic rank</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943278">динамичен ранг</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29135_1506695_1943279"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item that is excluded from a crawl by the administrator of the host site or the searc