pe="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29166_1506750_1943300"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process that automatically determines the language code identifier (LCID) for text in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506750">language auto-detection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943300">автоматско откривање јазик</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29167_1506751_1523112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A folder that is contained within a SharePoint list. A list folder can contain documents or list items, and it retains the characteristics of other items in the list, such as a customizable schema.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506751">list folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1523112">папка од список</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29168_1506752_1943301"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A page that allows users to create, view, or edit an item in a list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506752">list form</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGr