rip type="definition">A user interface element that displays a list of active fields in a PivotChart® view and is used to apply filters to those fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506795">PivotChart filter pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943330">Окно со филтри на PivotChart</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29210_1506796_1943331"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A PivotTable® field that is in the PivotTable area where the data values are shown.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506796">PivotTable data field</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943331">Поле со податоци на PivotTable</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29211_1506797_1943332"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user interface element that displays a list of all PivotTable® fields. A PivotTable field list can be used to populate a PivotTable report and to manipulate the fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506797">PivotTable field list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943332">Список со полиња на Pivo