-based implementation that enables users to gain access to multiple resources without entering their credentials multiple times.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507125">SSO system</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943425">SSO-систем</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29267_1506864_1523174"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A token that contains the encrypted identity of a single sign-on (SSO) user in the form of a security identifier string and a nonce.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506864">single sign-on ticket</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1523174">билет за ССО</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29267_1506864_1943374"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A token that contains the encrypted identity of a single sign-on (SSO) user in the form of a security identifier string and a nonce.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506864">single sign-on ticket</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943374">билет за еднократно пријавување</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29267_1507124_1523174"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A token that contains the encrypted identity of a single sign-on (SSO) user in the form of a security identifier string and a nonce.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507124">SSO ticket</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1523174">билет за ССО</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29267_1507124_1943374"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A token that contains the encrypted identity of a single sign-on (SSO) user in the form of a security identifier string and a nonce.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507124">SSO ticket</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943374">билет за еднократно пријавување</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29268_1506865_1523163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user who has administrative permissions for a site collection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506865">site collection administrator</term><termNot