ar keyword. When a user types a keyword synonym, search returns the same Best Bet result as the keyword.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507613">keyword synonym</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943436">синоним на клучен збор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29417_1507615_1523124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of users that is specific to the User Profile service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507615">member group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1523124">група на членови</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29418_1507617_1943438"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom security descriptor that is in an arbitrary format and is handled by alternate authentication providers that are used in pluggable security authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507617">search security descriptor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943438">опишувач на безбедност на пребарување</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29419_1507618_1943439"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An index in which the first item has an index of zero.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507618">zero-based index</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943439">индекс заснован на нула</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29420_1507690_1868523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Office Web Component that provides interactive charting functionality on a Web page. You can illustrate data in a chart and give users the ability to change data, change chart options, and see changes reflected in the chart.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507690">Chart Component</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868523">Компонента на графикон</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29429_1508178_1868524"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A character that is part of the set that makes up a particular language, such as vowels and consonants.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="15081