e the layout of the report. On a new report, dashed blue outlines indicate the pivot area on the worksheet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231969">pivot area</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868160">pivot-област</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31002_1586827_1664808"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The program that enables developers to connect to Live and easily use Microsoft account, OneDrive, Hotmail, and Messenger within their apps, websites, and devices. Live Connect provides a set of standards-based APIs and the downloadable Live SDK.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1586827">Live Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1664808">Live Connect</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31003_1586834_1644183"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A nonfinal release of Windows that's made available to developers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1586834">Windows Developer Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1644183">Windows Developer Preview</term><termN