nd a metadata term set, and that enables friendly URLs for pages in the navigation structure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1645773">managed navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868692">управувана навигација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32275_1645776_1868693"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that displays a preview of item content when a user hovers over a search result in SharePoint. The preview is optimized for the content type.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1645776">Quick Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868693">Брз увид</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32276_1645779_1868695"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that stores information about compatibility issues and workarounds and makes it available to the Office Telemetry Log and Office Telemetry Dashboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1645779">Office compatibility definition file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868695">Датотека со дефиниции за компатибилност со Of