 both spoken and visual instructions at the right time for the user to act on those instructions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067028">start voice nav</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081453">свиок по свиок</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35723_2067029_2081453"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The option that provides driving or walking directions to the user where the app provides both spoken and visual instructions at the right time for the user to act on those instructions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067029">turn-by-turn</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081453">свиок по свиок</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35724_2067030_2081409"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A camera option that enables users to capture moving subjects by snapping multiple photos on shutter press and allowing the user to pick the best one or just accept the photo recommended by the software.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067030">burst mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081409">фотосерија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35725_2067031_2081472"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The phone's LED light used during video capture to help exposure in dark conditions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067031">video light</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081472">видеосветло</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35726_2067032_2081456"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to sync some of the settings on your phone across all of your Windows 8 devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067032">sync my settings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081456">синхронизирај параметри</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35727_2067033_2081457"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To touch an NFC-capable device to a tag, an NFC reader, or another device to wirelessly transfer content or information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067033">tap</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081457">допри</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35728_2067075_2081407"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A ticket for transit, such as on an airplane or a train.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067075">boarding pass</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081407">патнички билет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35729_2067076_2081448"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The hardware slot (or tray) in which a SIM card is placed. Some phones have more than one SIM slot.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067076">SIM slot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081448">отвор за СИМ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3573_73656_441703"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol or protocols operating at a particular level within a protocol suite, such as IP within the TCP/IP suite.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73656">layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441703">слој</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35730_2067078_2081408"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The multiple photos taken on shutter press to capture moving subjects. The user can pick the best one or just accept the photo recommended by the software.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067078">burst</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081408">фотосерија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35731_2067079_2081427"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A span of IP addresses.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067079">IP range</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2081427">Опсег на ИП</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="gramma