maticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37472_2138914_2178505"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode in which the user can manipulate a 3D object by moving it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2138914">move mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2178505">режим за преместување</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37474_2139114_2158690"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database that stores search settings which include, but are not limited to search topology settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139114">search administration database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2158690">база со податоци за пребарувања на администраторот</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37475_2139115_2158683"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The webpage that displays all the apps that a particular user has a license to and that is scoped to the individual user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139115">My apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:l