calNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39470_2294324_2308061"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office feature that enables the user to get contextually relevant information to the keyword or phrase they highlighted in their document from Bing and helps with enhancing their understanding of the content they are working with.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2294324">Smart Lookup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2308061">Паметно барање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39471_2294327_2308646"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that automatically generates a preview of a link pasted into email, showing a snippet of content from a webpage or video.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2294327">Link Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2308646">Преглед на врска</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39472_2906525_2308060"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that provides suggestions to users for improving the design of their documents that can be applied with a single tap.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term i