a variety of apps into sways.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329599">Send to Sway</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342509">Испрати во Sway</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40093_2329763_2342507"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The blog platform on Docs.com where users can share their posts using Sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329763">Journal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342507">Дневник</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40107_2330211_2342505"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SharePoint authoring tool that allows users to create different types of SharePoint pages such as microsites, articles, and blogs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2330211">authoring canvas</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342505">платно за авторизација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammatic