ate store</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334335">приватна продавница</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40112_2330405_2334350"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A map downloaded to your PC, phone or tablet that can be used to get directions and search for places even when you are not connected to the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2330405">offline map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334350">офлајн мапа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40116_2331304_2334341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person or business that makes line-of-business apps available to customers through an online market.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331304">line-of-business publisher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334341">деловен издавач</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40116_2331304_2334343"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person or business that makes line-of-business apps available to customers through an online market.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331304">line-of-business publisher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334343">ЛОБ-издавач</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40116_2331305_2334341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person or business that makes line-of-business apps available to customers through an online market.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331305">LOB publisher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334341">деловен издавач</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40116_2331305_2334343"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person or business that makes line-of-business apps available to customers through an online market.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331305">LOB publisher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334343">ЛОБ-издавач</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40118_2331575_2334344"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that is licensed by a company in bulk for use by end users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331575">volume application</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334344">групна апликација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40121_2331937_2342874"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An automatically generated filter list in Wunderlist (e.g. Today, Week, Assigned to me, Starred, All, and Completed Smart List) that shows all tasks from across all your task lists that meet the specific criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331937">smart list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342874">паметен список</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40122_2331938_2342877"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Mac OS X specific part of the app that allows Wunderlist to receive push notifications on the Mac.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331938">Wunderlist Helper</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342877">Помош за Wunderlist</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40123_2331939_2342873"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Wunderlist feature that allows users to enter due dates for a task as text (e.g. next Sunday), automatically recognize the date, and set a due date and reminder for the task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331939">Smart Due Dates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342873">Паметни рокови</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40124_2332081_2342872"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that gives users information regarding the safety of a message via a colored bar inserted into the message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332081">Safety Tips</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342872">Безбедносни совети</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40126_2332083_2342870"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows administrators to inform email senders that they may be about to violate one of the data loss prevention policies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332083">Policy Tips</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342870">Совети за правилата</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40161_2333639_2340214"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to tap a phone against another device to pay for a purchase using a credit or debit card enrolled in Microsoft Wallet as a method of payment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333639">tap to pay</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340214">плаќање со допирање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40162_2333642_2342866"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A UI element that gives a user a view of the important email, as presorted by the Focused Inbox feature.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333642">Focused</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342866">Фокусирано</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40163_2333645_2342868"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The email management approach developed by productivity expert Merlin Mann so that zero time is spent thinking about email without any of the five actions he identified.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333645">Inbox Zero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342868">Исчистено сандаче</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4017_397157_2305545"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A storage platform that provides a single repository for managing multiple types of unstructured information in one infrastructure. The Exchange store combines the features and functionality of the file system, the Web, and a collaboration server (such as Microsoft Exchange) through a single, URL-addressable location for storing, accessing, and managing information, as well as building and running applications. The Exchange store is also known as the Web Storage System.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397157">Exchange store</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2305545">Склад на Exchange</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40220_2338748_2340221"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service designed to provide single sign-on for browser, apps, and services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2338748">Web Account Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340221">Администратор на корисничка веб-сметка</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40224_2339657_2340212"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app ​that lets you edit a song, so you can save part of it as a ringtone.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2339657">Ringtone Maker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340212">Креатор на мелодии</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40226_2339682_2346997"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets users draw someone's attention to an email message or calendar item by adding the @ symbol followed by the person's name to the body of the message or item. When this happens, the person will be notified automatically that they were mentioned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2339682">Mentions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2346997">Напомени</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40226_2339682_2678666"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets users draw someone's attention to an email message or calendar item by adding the @ symbol followed by the person's name to the body of the message or item. When this happens, the person will be notified automatically that they were mentioned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2339682">Mentions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2678666">@напомени</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40226_2677038_2346997"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets users draw someone's attention to an email message or calendar item by adding the @ symbol followed by the person's name to the body of the message or item. When this happens, the person will be notified automatically that they were mentioned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2677038">@mentions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2346997">Напомени</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40226_2677038_2678666"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets users draw someone's attention to an email message or calendar item by adding the @ symbol followed by the person's name to the body of the message or item. When this happens, the person will be notified automatically that they were mentioned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2677038">@mentions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2678666">@напомени</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40227_2339683_2346998"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The slide transition in PowerPoint that smoothly animates objects across slides.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2339683">Morph</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2346998">Трансформација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</