er.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="180480">Microsoft Update website</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1693567">Microsoft Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4042_464491_1693567"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A website from Microsoft which provides updates (patches and fixes) for multiple Microsoft products in one place, including Windows operating system software and Windows-based hardware, Microsoft Office system, Microsoft SQL Server, and Microsoft Exchange Server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="464491">Microsoft Update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1693567">Microsoft Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40423_2347704_2350240"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A request for response based on the French, Répondez s’il vous plaît.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2347704">RSVP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2350240">RSVP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40430_2347754_2349261"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service plan offer covering domestic calls as part of the PSTN Calling service in Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2347754">Skype for Business PSTN Domestic Calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349261">Домашни повици преку PSTN за Skype за компании</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40431_2347755_2349262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service plan offer covering international calls as part of the PSTN Calling service in Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2347755">Skype for Business PSTN International Calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349262">Меѓународни повици преку PSTN за Skype за компании</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40432_2347756_2349260"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service plan offer covering domestic and international calls as part of the PSTN Calling service in Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2347756">Skype for Business PSTN Domestic and International Calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349260">Домашни и меѓународни повици преку PSTN за Skype за компании</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40436_2349281_2352978"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item showing hearts (number of likes) for a given chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349281">Show likes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352978">Прикажи ги допаѓањата</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40438_2349283_2352979"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item connected the heart-feature, whereby a participant can remove a "heart" from a chat message, indicating that the participant does not like a chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349283">Unlike</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352979">Не ми се допаѓа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40439_2349284_2352975"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An amount of money added to an account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349284">credit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352975">кредит</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40440_2349285_2352976"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item connected the heart-feature, whereby a participant can give a "heart" to a chat message, indicating that the participant likes a chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349285">Like</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352976">Ми се допаѓа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40441_2349286_2352977"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of hearts showing how many particpant have liked a chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349286">Likes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352977">Допаѓања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40454_3113359_3137218"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The security service that provides a consolidated view into risk events and potential vulnerabilities affecting your organization’s identities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113359">Microsoft Entra ID Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3137218">Заштита за Microsoft Entra ID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40474_2350857_3025260"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A servicing release cadence to receive development builds. Each ring is defined by a different release frequency and level of stability.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2350857">ring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3025260">круг</term><termNote ty