mail, social media and public cloud. It includes encryption of enterprise data when it enters the device or is created on the device, such that data stays protected against disclosure to applications and endpoints outside enterprise control.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2405212">Windows Information Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2405724">Windows Information Protection</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4050_95643_441878"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A standard set of formats and procedures that enable computers to exchange information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="95643">protocol</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441878">протокол</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353112_2353652"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353112">Windows Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353652">Центар за повратни информации</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353112_2353653"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353112">Windows Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353653">Центар за повратни информации на Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353113_2353652"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353113">Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353652">Центар за повратни информации</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353113_2353653"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353113">Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353653">Центар за повратни информации на Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40503_2353114_2353641"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of settings that admins can use to manage files and operating system settings on enterprise-owned devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353114">enterprise control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353641">организациска контрола</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40504_2353123_2353639"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The modern implementation of Windows PowerShell built on .NET Core. It includes a command-line shell, scripting language, and automation engine, providing IT administrators comprehensive control and automation of system administration tasks across multiple platforms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353123">PowerShell Core</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353639">PowerShell Core</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40511_2353386_2354203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The group of add-ons for Office 2016 that includes one or more of the following: proofing tools, an LIP, a language pack, and/or a spellchecker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353386">Office 2016 Language Accessory Pack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354203">Office 2016 Language Accessory Pack</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40521_2353984_2357922"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A free feature that allows setting up online business meetings using work email. The feature is part of Skype for Business experience and has multiple online entry-points (e.g. Skype.com).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353984">Skype Meetings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357922">Состаноци на Skype</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40523_2354097_2355321"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Big Data Analysis Generic Enabler reference implementation (GEri) intended to deploy means for analyzing both batch and stream data and get insights on such a data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354097">Cosmos</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2355321">Cosmos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40524_2354098_2355324"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A query expressed in the native SQL dialect of the database of choice.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354098">native database query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2355324">локален прашалник за базата на податоци</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40524_2354098_2355325"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A query expressed in the native SQL dialect of the database of choice.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354098">native database query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2355325">локален прашалник</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40524_2354101_2355324"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A query expressed in the native SQL dialect of the database of choice.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354101">native query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2355324">локален прашалник за базата на податоци</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40524_2354101_2355325"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A query expressed in the native SQL dialect of the database of choice.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354101">native query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2355325">локален прашалник</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4053_11478_441252"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keyboard key that is used in conjunction with another key to produce some special feature or function and is typically marked with the letters Alt.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="11478">ALT key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441252">ALT-копче</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40537_2354519_2357150"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The phone app that helps customers transfer content from their Android phone to their Windows 10 Mobile phone. There are 2 instances of the app, one that you install on Android, and one that you install on Windows (phone only).​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354519">Move to Windows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357150">Пренесување во Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40541_2354632_2687083"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistical measure of the reliability of an estimate, which calculates the margin of error.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354632">confidence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2687083">веродостојност</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21561_441315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21561">bit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441315">бит</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21561_441316"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21561">bit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441316">бинарен број</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21562_441315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21562">binary digit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441315">бит</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21562_441316"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21562">binary digit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441316">бинарен број</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4059_124417_1868020"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file (or component within another file) that contains Automation standard descriptions of exposed objects, properties, and methods.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="124417">type library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868020">библиотеката со типови</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="406_22638_2305450"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A portion of content within an email or Internet newsgroups, that follows the header and contains the content of the message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="22638">body</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2305450">тело</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40601_2357561_2357929"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Skype for Business PSTN Consumption billing enables customers to access PSTN features that are not available in the base PSTN Conferencing and PSTN Calling subscriptions, such as toll-free dial in for conferences, international dial out in conferences, and international dial out for PSTN Calling Domestic Plans</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357561">Skype for Business PSTN Consumption</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357929">PSTN-потрошувачка на Skype за компании</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote>