eset layout, enable/disable transition in their Summary Zoom, Slide Zoom, or Section Zoom, and return to Zoom.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2393983">Zoom Options</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397825">Опции за зумирање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42308_2394267_2513006"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based hosting service for version control using Git.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2394267">GitHub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513006">GitHub</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42317_2394284_2556700"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A formal approach used by organizations to orchestrate, prioritize and benefit from projects by examining the risk-reward of each project, the available funds, the likelihood of a project's duration, and the expected outcomes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2394284">project portfolio management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2556700">УПП</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</ter