<descrip type="definition">A formal approach used by organizations to orchestrate, prioritize and benefit from projects by examining the risk-reward of each project, the available funds, the likelihood of a project's duration, and the expected outcomes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2394292">PPM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2556701">управување со портфолио со проекти</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42326_2394553_2396505"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">After a build update, to load an app with domain data (such as data from a database, from the network, or from a file system), during the download process. Before this step, the app cannot be used.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2394553">hydrate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396505">хидрирај</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42327_2394727_2422435"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for multi-factor authentication, device registration to Azure AD, and SSO/certificate-based authentication against Azure AD that generates a security code the user must enter to verify his/her identity or, for enterprise users, a QR code to scan.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term 