 the status bar, and which shows the ribbon when the cursor is moved to the top of the screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2407531">Focus Mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2411594">Режим за фокус</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42470_2407565_2465872"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 service for small businesses that includes customizable Web-based booking pages where customers can book appointments for services and that sends out email confirmations, reminders, updates, and cancelation notices to customers and employees.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2407565">Microsoft Bookings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2465872">Bookings</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42470_2462549_2465872"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 service for small businesses that includes customizable Web-based booking pages where customers can book appointments for services and that sends out email confirmations, reminders, updates, and cancelation notices to customers and employees.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2462549">Bookings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Pr