s to translate the cylinder, head, and sector specifications of the drive into addresses that can be used by an enhanced BIOS. LBA is used with drives that are larger than 528MB.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="211449">LBA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1371464">ЛБА</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4315_211449_442371"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method used with SCSI and IDE disk drives to translate the cylinder, head, and sector specifications of the drive into addresses that can be used by an enhanced BIOS. LBA is used with drives that are larger than 528MB.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="211449">LBA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="442371">адресирање логички блокови</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43163_2445821_2448407"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature within Microsoft Edge where people can access e-books and other e-publications that they purchase or download.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2445821">Books</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2448407">Книги</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43166_2445824_2448420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to convert an image of writing to editable digital ink.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2445824">ink grab</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2448420">дигитални белешки</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43167_2453892_2524737"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature which allows you to stay connected and quickly interact and share with the people you care about most.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453892">My People</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2524737">Мои луѓе</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43169_2445827_2448432"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The major Windows 10 update to be released in Spring 2017, focused on creativity, 3D and mixed reality, 4K gaming, game broadcasting, among other features for both consumer and enterpri