chment when it is sent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2450822">Modern Attachments</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2454554">Модерен прилог</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43285_2451017_2454553"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The pane in Office 365 applications that shows the user information such as previous editors and historical versions of the file they have opened.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451017">Activity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2454553">Активност</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43293_2451801_2452354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area of the Windows Defender app that contains app install rule, SmartScreen settings, and exploit protection settings.​​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451801">App &amp; browser control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2452354">Контрола на апликации и прегледувачи</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</ter