that uses digital cards to achieve just-in-time delivery and manage the replenishment cycle in a manufacturing process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2570262">Kanban</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2576488">Канбан</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4561_319151_442953"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The " character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319151">straight quotation mark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="442953">прави наводници</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45634_2572083_2578124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox One support app that allows users to optimize their Xbox experience, stay informed about issues, get personalized help and take actions to solve issues or improve their overall experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2572083">Xbox Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2578124">Помош на Xbox</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4565_31042_1485341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of finalizing a purchase on a website. For example, when customers shop on your website, they may select several items and save them in their shopping basket. When they have finished shopping, they click on a checkout link or graphical button that takes them to an online form where they enter their name, billing address, payment type, and shipping information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="31042">checkout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1485341">наплаќање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4566_118879_441976"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu that contains commands you can use to manipulate a window or close a program. You click the program icon at the left of the title bar to open this menu. The context menu of a window replaces this menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="118879">system menu</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441976">контролно мени</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4566_118880_441976"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu that contains commands you can use to manipulate a window or close a program. You click the program icon at the left of the title bar to open this menu. The context menu of a window replaces this menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="118880">control menu</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441976">контролно мени</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4567_232422_1868179"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The container in a navigation pane that contains shortcuts and shortcut groups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232422">Shortcuts Pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868179">Окно со кратенки</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45684_2573934_2575300"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that enables Skype users to make calls to (and receive calls from) mobile phones and landlines and send and receive SMS messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2573934">Phone Plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575300">Пакет за телефонија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45685_2573938_2575301"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that enables Skype users to make calls from Skype to mobile phones or landlines, paid for by purchasing credits or a monthly subscription.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2573938">Skype to Phone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575301">Skype на телефон</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45689_2575485_2578945"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office feature that allows users to translate words, segments or full texts and that is powered exclusively by the cloud-based Microsoft Translator service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575485">Translator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2578945">Преведувач</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4569_116311_441959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In information processing, fixed or predetermined.</descrip></descri