 users choose which buttons perform which actions on Xbox Wireless Controllers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619581">Xbox Accessories</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2620396">Xbox додатоци</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46540_2619582_2620385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live feature allowing the user to create and customize their avatars as well as purchase new avatar items like clothes, accessories and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619582">Xbox Avatar Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2620385">Уредувач на аватар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46540_2619582_2620398"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live feature allowing the user to create and customize their avatars as well as purchase new avatar items like clothes, accessories and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619582">Xbox Avatar Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2620398">Уредувач на аватар на Xbox</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46540_2619583_2620385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live feature allowing the user to create and customize their avatars as well as purchase new avatar items like clothes, accessories and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619583">Avatar Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2620385">Уредувач на аватар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46540_2619583_2620398"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live feature allowing the user to create and customize their avatars as well as purchase new avatar items like clothes, accessories and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619583">Avatar Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2620398">Уредувач на аватар на Xbox</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46542_2619590_2619945"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The auto chat moderation tool in Mixer that looks at the context of messages people are sending and “snipes” content the user finds inappropriate before it hits their channel. Users can preview messages removed, and report inaccuracies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619590">Catbot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619945">Catbot</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46554_2671644_2673366"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that analyzes clients' usage, provides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2671644">Security Policy Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673366">Советник за безбедносна политика</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46554_2671644_2765729"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that analyzes clients' usage, provides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2671644">Security Policy Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2765729">СБП</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46554_2764076_2673366"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that analyzes clients' usage, provides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2764076">SPA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673366">Советник за безбедносна политика</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46554_2764076_2765729"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that analyzes clients' usage, provides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2764076">SPA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2765729">СБП</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage