ty &amp; Compliance Center feature that allows admins to track ongoing security problems and campaigns as well as general trends and queries.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2701277">Threat tracker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2703442">Следење закани</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47933_2701278_2703440"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 Security &amp; Compliance Center feature that allows admins to trace the flow of email in their organization, filter the results, and export them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2701278">Message trace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2703440">Трага на пораката</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4794_111703_1832359"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The procedures involved in preparing a software program or application to operate within a computer or mobile device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="111703">setup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1832359">поставки</term><termNote type="geographicalUsag