igate and resolve security vulnerabilities affecting Microsoft products and services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741563">Security Response Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2744343">Центар за безбедносни интервенции на Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48497_2741563_2744346"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft center staffed with security experts that investigate and resolve security vulnerabilities affecting Microsoft products and services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741563">Security Response Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2744346">ЦБИМ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48497_2741563_2744367"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft center staffed with security experts that investigate and resolve security vulnerabilities affecting Microsoft products and services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741563">Security Response Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2744367">Центар за безбедносни интервенции</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48498_2741564_2744339"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A configuration that prevents devices that share a physical network from being able to communicate with each other.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741564">logical isolation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2744339">логичка изолација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48501_2742469_2748662"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mechanism by which networks control the rate of traffic sent or received by a network adapter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2742469">rate limiting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2748662">ограничување на проток</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48502_2742476_2748643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The resource available to enterprise customers that provides answers to questions about the accessibility of Microsoft products and service and about product compliance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2742476">Enterprise Disability Answer Desk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2748643">Биро за прашања на деловните корисници со посебни потреби</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48503_2742482_2748655"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The website that  contains resources for people with disabilities and for companies that want to make their content accessible for all.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2742482">Office Accessibility Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2748655">Центар за пристапност на Office</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48509_2742883_2748669"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A denial-of-service attack where an attacker sends a succession of SYN requests to a target's system to consume enough server resources to make the system unresponsive.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2742883">SYN flood</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2748669">поплава со СИНХ</term><termNote type="geog