s the program and can respond to input from users as well as act on is its own when performing automated tasks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2775736">control logic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2778817">логика за контрола</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4908_23140_441324"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The visible line around the edge of an object. For example, the four lines of a rectangle that comprise its border.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="23140">border</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441324">раб</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49107_2778504_2784051"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An individual who monitors an organization's compliance for processing data subject information under GDPR.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2778504">data protection officer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2784051">одговорно лице за заштита на податоците</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="gramm