ustries together to change the game against malware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842118">Coordinated Malware Eradication</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851595">Координирано искоренување на злонамерен софтвер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50253_2842118_2851596"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An industry collaboration program that aims to bring organizations in cybersecurity and in other industries together to change the game against malware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842118">Coordinated Malware Eradication</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851596">КИЗС</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50253_2842119_2851595"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An industry collaboration program that aims to bring organizations in cybersecurity and in other industries together to change the game against malware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842119">CME</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851595">Координирано искоренување на злонамерен софтвер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50253_2842119_2851596"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An industry collaboration program that aims to bring organizations in cybersecurity and in other industries together to change the game against malware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842119">CME</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851596">КИЗС</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50256_2842122_2842697"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An industry group where technology companies with mature security response processes come together to solve cross-industry problems and advance security across the ecosystem. (Microsoft was a founding member.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842122">Industry Consortium for the Advancement of Security on the Internet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842697">Industry Consortium for the Advancement of Security on the Internet</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5026_181997_1096071"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Code that is executed directly by the operating system, outside the .NET Framework common language runtime. Unmanaged code must provide its own memory management, type checking, and security support, unlike managed code, which receives these services from the common language runtime.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="181997">unsafe code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1096071">неуправуван код</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5026_181998_1096071"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Code that is executed directly by the operating system, outside the .NET Framework common language runtime. Unmanaged code must provide its own memory management, type checking, and security support, unlike managed code, which receives these services from the common language runtime.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="181998">unmanaged code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1096071">неуправуван код</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50268_2843747_2851292"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Zero Trust access policy that limits user access with Just-In-Time and Just-Enough Access (JIT/JEA) risk-based adaptive polices and data protection to protect both data and productivity</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843747">least privileged access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851292">пристап со најниско ниво на привилегии</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50269_2843748_2851206"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A special telephone number used for participating in conference calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843748">dial-in number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851206">број за бирање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50269_2844095_2851206"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A special telephone number used for participating in conference calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844095">dial in number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851206">број за бирање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50270_2843760_2851341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The overall security status of an enterprise’s software and hardware, networks, services, and information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843760">security posture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851341">состојба со безбедноста</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50273_2843779_2851199"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A class of security tools that assures a continuous process of cloud security improvement and adaptation to reduce the likelihood of a successful attack, including use cases for compliance monitoring, DevOps integration, incident response, risk assessment, and risk visualization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843779">cloud security posture management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851199">управување со состојбата на безбедност во облак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50273_2843779_2851203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A class of security tools that assures a continuous process of cloud security improvement and adaptation to reduce the likelihood of a successful attack, including use cases for compliance monitoring, DevOps integration, incident response, risk assessment, and risk visualization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843779">cloud security posture management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851203">УСБО</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50273_2843780_2851199"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A class of security tools that assures a continuous process of cloud security improvement and adaptation to reduce the likelihood of a successful attack, including use cases for compliance monitoring, DevOps integration, incident response, risk assessment, and risk visualization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843780">CSPM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851199">управување со состојбата на безбедност во облак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50273_2843780_2851203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A class of security tools that assures a continuous process of cloud security improvement and adaptation to reduce the likelihood of a successful attack, including use cases for compliance monitoring, DevOps integration, incident response, risk assessment, and risk visualization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843780">CSPM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851203">УСБО</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50274_2843783_2851200"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An emerging category of technology solutions primarily used to secure server workloads in public cloud Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) environments. They commonly include functions such as system hardening, vulnerability management, host-based segmentation, system integrity monitoring, and application allowlisting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843783">cloud workload protection platform</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851200">платформа за заштита на работата во облак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50274_2843783_2851204"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An emerging category of technology solutions primarily used to secure server workloads in public cloud Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) environments. They commonly include functions such as system hardening, vulnerability management, host-based segmentation, system integrity monitoring, and application allowlisting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843783">cloud workload protection platform</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851204">ПЗРО</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50274_2843784_2851200"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An emerging category of technology solutions primarily used to secure server workloads in public cloud Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) environments. They commonly include functions such as system hardening, vulnerability management, host-based segmentation, system integrity monitoring, and application allowlisting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843784">CWPP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851200">платформа за заштита на работата во облак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50274_2843784_2851204"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An emerging category of technology solutions primarily used to secure server workloads in public cloud Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) environments. They commonly include functions such as system hardening, vulnerability management, host-based segmentation, system integrity monitoring, and application allowlisting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843784">CWPP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851204">ПЗРО</term>