 to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2860780">hardware-enforced stack protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3020647">HSP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50521_3019770_3020647"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Shadow Stack security feature that prevents a class of vulnerabilities known as Return-Oriented Programming (ROP) and requires hardware in order to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3019770">HSP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3020647">HSP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50539_2862041_2862736"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A web-hosted technology product such as file storage, webmail, search engines, and calendar management.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862041">service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862736">услуга</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50540_2862042_2862735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft web-hosted technology product such as Bing, MSN, OneDrive, Outlook.com, Devices, and Profile, all of which are accessed via a Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862042">Microsoft Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862735">услуга на Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50541_2862043_2862737"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A cryptographic algorithm used to create a hash value with 64 hexadecimal characters, or the hash value itself.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862043">SHA-256</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862737">SHA-256</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50543_2862396_2862800"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The personalized information stream feature of Microsoft Launcher that includes news, events from the user's calendar, photos, notes, contacts, recently-launched apps, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862396">feed</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862800">информациски канал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50544_2862397_2862803"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Launcher page consisting of a card that has been pinned to the Home screen providing a full-screen experience to card users with all filters and sorting preserved as of the moment the page was pinned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862397">pinned page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862803">прикачена страница</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50547_2862401_2862802"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Microsoft Edge that notifies users whenever a password that they have saved through the browser has been identified as compromised.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862401">Password Monitor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862802">Надгледување лозинки</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50548_2862405_2862804"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Edge feature that allows users to select, copy, and paste content that they find across the Web while maintaining the source site's formatting, spacing, and text so the copy looks like the original.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862405">Smart copy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862804">Паметно копирање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50549_2862409_2862805"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets Microsoft Edge users move their horizontal tabs at the top of the browser to a vertical pane at the right side of their screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862409">vertical tabs</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862805">вертикални картички</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50556_2862646_2863546"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Microsoft Stream that allows users with admin rights to mark specific videos to ensure that they appear on the Stream portal when users log in.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862646">spotlight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></