p type="definition">An XML document that specifies a list of sites, their compatibility mode, and their intended browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2947723">Enterprise Mode Site List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2948392">список на веб-локации во деловен режим</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52144_2947724_2948399"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A benefit, advantage, or discount provided to a customer when they use a product in association with a Windows device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2947724">Windows benefit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2948399">погодност на системот Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52146_2947726_2948367"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category of products across the industry that deliver the full PC/desktop experience running in the cloud, accessible through a browser or a remote-access app; a hybrid OS working on any device as a cloud-based service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2947726">Cloud PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml