pe="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53003_3012998_3014167"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to create a child email address or a disposable email address based on your standard email address, adding a "+"  suffix to the local part of your email address.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012998">plus addressing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014167">создавање подредена адреса на е-пошта</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53003_3012999_3014164"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to create a child email address or a disposable email address based on your standard email address, adding a "+"  suffix to the local part of your email address.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012999">subaddressing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014164">создавање адреса на е-пошта со знакот плус</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53003_3012999_3014167"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to create a child email address or a disposable email address based on your standard email address, adding a "+"  suffix to t