ar</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023915">S&amp;P 500</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53117_3023502_3023914"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A label for cloud apps whose publishers have partnered with Microsoft to disclose their own assessment of the security and compliance safeguards in their code and infrastructure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023502">publisher-attested</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023914">потврдено од издавачот</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53118_3023503_3023912"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The capability that allows Microsoft partners and resellers that are signed up to be Microsoft advisors to manage Microsoft 365 as if they were an admin within their customers' Microsoft 365 organizations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023503">delegated administration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023912">делегирана администрација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGr