 type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53235_3033414_3034159"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The simulator for ARDK head-mounted displays that runs on Windows PCs and requires a physical + connected Samsung phone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033414">ARDK Simulator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034159">Симулатор за ARDK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53236_3033415_3034157"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application for ARDK users that provides the software platform for ARDK features like hand tracking and eye tracking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033415">ARDK Platform</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034157">Платформа за ARDK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53237_3033416_3034153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application for ARDK users that hosts the system UI, including the application launcher, dock, and task bar.</descrip></descripGrp><