 operating system with a command-line interface that is used to control many internal computer functions, such as running programs and organizing and maintaining files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="82028">MS-DOS operating system</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441773">Microsoft диск-оперативен систем</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5371_82029_441772"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft computer operating system with a command-line interface that is used to control many internal computer functions, such as running programs and organizing and maintaining files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="82029">Microsoft Disk Operating System</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441772">MS-DOS-оперативен систем</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5371_82029_441773"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft computer operating system with a command-line interface that is used to control many internal computer functions, such as running programs and organizing and maintaining files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="82029">Microsoft Disk Operating System</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><te