 specification for RGB devices that can be adjusted in the Settings app for Windows users to view and customize their RGB devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097241">Dynamic Lighting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3098052">Динамично осветлување</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5432_126334_1832421"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process of transferring a copy of a file from a local computer to a remote computer by means of a modem or network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="126334">upload</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1832421">поставување</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5434_119301_1372350"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A location on the horizontal ruler that indicates how far to indent text or where to begin a column of text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="119301">tab stop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372350">позиција на табулаторот</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><te