ge that has been cut or copied. To cancel a moving border, press ESC.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="144872">moving border</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868082">подвижна граница</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5452_25722_441338"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unit of memory measurement that consists of eight bits.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25722">byte</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441338">бајт</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54539_3099039_3099556"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The holiday that commemorates the birthday of His Majesty King Charles III.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099039">King’s Birthday</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099556">Роденден на кралот</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54540_3099040_3099555"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The holiday that commemorates the crowning of His Majesty King Charles III.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099040">Coronation Day for King Charles III</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099555">Ден на крунисувањето на кралот Чарлс III</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54541_3099042_3102119"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows leaders to encourage open dialog and feedback across communities and teams through news, Ask Me Anything (AMA) events, surveys, and more in Viva Engage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099042">Leadership Corner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3102119">Катче за лидери</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54542_3099043_3102117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of metrics available to Viva suite licensed customers that allows users to gain a deeper understanding of engagement and trends happening across Viva Engage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099043">Advanced Analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSele