es infographics, videos, and an email to help users protect identities, devices, and data, safeguard from phishing and other scams, manage passwords efficiently and keep software up to date.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103946">Be Cyber Smart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104301">Безбедност на интернет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54664_3103947_3104066"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Jargon or popular language for the use of multiple cloud computing and storage services in a single heterogeneous architecture.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103947">multicloud</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104066">опкружување со повеќе облаци</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54665_3103948_3104067"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows customers to cryptographically tie tokens to the device a user originally signed in from.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103948">token protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104067">заштита со токени</t