 such as macros. Characters commonly reserved for special uses include the asterisk (*), forward slash (/), backslash (\), question mark (?), and vertical bar (|).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="103458">reserved character</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1096012">резервиран знак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55164_3126700_3127735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The dedicated Microsoft Edge experience built for work that enables admins in organizations to give their users a productive and secure work browser across managed and unmanaged devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3126700">Microsoft Edge for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127735">Microsoft Edge за компании</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55165_3126701_3127736"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The directory service that provides authentication, authorization, and password management for Microsoft Windows networks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3126701">Microsoft Entra Domain Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127736">Доменски услуги на Microsoft Entra</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55165_3126701_3127737"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The directory service that provides authentication, authorization, and password management for Microsoft Windows networks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3126701">Microsoft Entra Domain Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127737">Доменски услуги</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55165_3126702_3127736"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The directory service that provides authentication, authorization, and password management for Microsoft Windows networks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3126702">Domain Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127736">Доменски услуги на Microsoft Entra</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55165_3126702_3127737"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The directory service that provides authentication, authorization, and password management for Microsoft Windows networks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3126702">Domain Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127737">Доменски услуги</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55166_3126703_3127738"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows service responsible for managing updates in the background, handling downloads, installations, and the maintenance of updates on the user's computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3126703">Update Orchestrator Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127738">Update Orchestrator Service</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55167_3127754_3128268"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Teams add-on license that allows offices to designate devices as shared devices, including common area phones, Teams displays for hot-desks, and Teams panels for meeting spaces.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127754">Microsoft Teams Shared Devices</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig>