ing and updating context indexes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="361627">content index server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1095907">сервер за индекс на содржина</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8356_116839_441964"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a formatting style in which characters are crossed out by horizontal line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="116839">strikethrough</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441964">прецртување</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="836_156769_1485335"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any software update or new intellectual property such as a driver, connector, development kit, guidance, or tool.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="156769">supplement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1485335">додаток</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8369_226552_1465427"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that notifies a user when there is a change to posted content, workflow status, or when other user-defined criteria are met.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="226552">alert</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1465427">внимание</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8370_143265_1868067"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of the last 10 files you jumped to in the current program session using hyperlinks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143265">History list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1868067">Историски список</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8371_46702_1943035"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A portion of a computer's random access memory (RAM) set aside for temporarily holding information read from disk. A disk cache does not hold entire files, as does a RAM disk (a portion of memory that acts as if it were a disk drive). Instead, a disk cache is used to hold information that either has recently been requested from disk or has previously been written to disk. If the required information remains in a disk cache, access time is considerably faster than if the program must wait for the disk drive mechanism to fetch the information from disk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="46702">disk cache</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1943035">кеш на диск</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8391_143066_1372391"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A non-printing line or point that can be used to help position or align objects or text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143066">guide</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372391">водич</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8396_2780918_2784064"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Office Online application that enables users to view, create, share, and collaborate on Excel documents in a Web browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2780918">Excel on the web</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2784064">Excel на веб</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8396_2780918_2784067"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Office Online application that enables users to view, create, share, and collaborate on Excel documents in a Web browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2780918">Excel on the web</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2784067">Microsoft Excel на веб</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8396_2780918_2820372"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Office Online application that enables users to view, create, share, and collaborate on Excel documents in a Web browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2780918">Excel on the web</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2820372">Excel за веб</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">MKD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8396_2781048_2784064"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Office Online application that enables users to view, create, share, and collaborate on Excel documents in a Web browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2781048">Microsof